th attribute. The text-x and text-y attributes are offsets that specify where the baseline of the start of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the ending text appears, relative to the start of the ending line."}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlending","title":"MXLEnding"}}}